<section class="section" aria-labelledby="published-presidential-polls">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="eyebrow dark">PUBLISHED POLLS · SOURCE COMPARISON</span>
    <h2 id="published-presidential-polls">Presidential percentages by poll source</h2>
    <p>Compare the published polls referenced on this website. These dated snapshots are updated manually. They are separate from the website survey above and are not combined into a final percentage or winner prediction.</p>
    <div class="row g-3">
      <% polls.forEach(poll=>{ %>
        <div class="col-lg-4">
          <article class="opinion-card h-100">
            <h3><%= poll.pollster %></h3>
            <p class="fine-print">Published <%= poll.published %><br>Fieldwork: <%= poll.fieldwork %></p>
            <p><%= poll.question %></p>
            <% poll.results.forEach(([name,percentage])=>{ %>
              <div class="poll-result">
                <div class="d-flex justify-content-between gap-3"><span><%= name %></span><strong><%= percentage %>%</strong></div>
                <div class="bar-track" role="img" aria-label="<%= name %>: <%= percentage %> percent"><div class="bar-fill" style="width:<%= Math.max(0,Math.min(100,percentage)) %>%"></div></div>
              </div>
            <% }) %>
            <p>Undecided (as reported): <strong><%= poll.undecided %>%</strong></p>
            <p class="fine-print">Some smaller categories are omitted; displayed shares may not total 100%.</p>
            <dl><dt>Sample</dt><dd><%= poll.sample %></dd><dt>Method</dt><dd><%= poll.method %></dd><dt>Reported margin of error</dt><dd><%= poll.margin %></dd></dl>
            <p class="fine-print"><%= poll.caveat %></p>
            <div class="notice"><strong>Source check: <%= poll.checkedAt %>.</strong> <%= poll.verification %></div>
            <a class="text-link" href="<%= poll.source %>" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Read the source publication</a>
          </article>
        </div>
      <% }) %>
    </div>
    <p class="fine-print mt-3">Coverage includes the three poll sources currently recorded on this site, rather than every poll published in Kenya. Different dates, questions, recruitment and weighting affect comparisons.</p>
    <a href="/polls">View the full poll register</a>
  </div>
</section>
